    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "UNITED\nSystem\nTimetable\nEffective May 1, 1991\nIntroducing\nNew Service to\nLondon's Heathrow Airport\nand on to\nAmsterdam\nBerlin\nBrussels\nFrankfurt\nHamburg\nMunich\nParis\nIncluding\nUNITED EXPRESS",
      "HONOLULU\nVANCOUVER, B.G\nSEATTLE- TACOI\n(SPOKANG.\nPORTLAN\nPENDLETON\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nRENO\nSAN FRANCISC\nSAN 10\nMON TEREY\nSALINAS\nACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO.\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nELY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nLLLAS VEGAS\nSANTA BARBARA\nSAN DIEGO\nHILO\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE / TACOMA\nPORTLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nBOSTON\nNEW YORK\nPHILADELPHIA\nWASHINGTON\nLOS ANGELES\nHONOLULU\nHILO\nTORONTO\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nSAGINAW BAY CIFY MIDLAND.\nMUSKEGON\nBOSTON\nROCHESTER HARTFORD-SPRINGFIELO\nBUFFALO\nPROVIDENCE\nMY-WAUKEE\nDETROIT\nGRAND RAPIOS\nALEVELAND\nSOUTH BEND\nTOLEDO YOUNGSTOWN-WARREN\nNEWARK\nAKRON-CANTOM SHARON ALLENTOWN-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\nPITTSBUR\nCEDAR RAPIDS MOLINE\nDES MOINES\nROCK ISLAND\nOMAHA\nFORT WAYNE\nIDAYTON COLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nCHARLESTON, W. VA.\nBALTIMORE WASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS-HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nRICHMOND\nNORFOLK-PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL-KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CLY\nGREENSBORO-HIGH POINT-\nWINSTON-SALEM\nRALEIGH -DURHAM\nKNOXVILLE\nCHATTANOOGA\nASHEVILLE\nCHARLOTTE\nMEMPHIS\nANTA\nHUN SVILLE\n**\nDISCOVER AMERICA\nBIRMINGHAM\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA-\nST. PETERSBURG.\nWEST PALM BEACH\nMIAMI-\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nTake me along\n(A little traveling music....from United)\nYour husband's going on a business trip?\nAnd you want to go along?\nWe have a sweet arrangement called\n\"Take Me Along.\"\nWe give him 25% off your fare.\nSide-by-side seating.\nChampagne cocktails (called Short Flings).\nReduced rates on hotel and rental car\nfor the weekend, in most cities.\nAnd he can charge everything on\none of the many credit cards we honor.\nSound great? Just call your Travel Agent.\nThen-music, maestro, if you please!\nfty the friendly skies of United.\n\"She sang me into it.\""
